WEBVTT

00:00:20.402 --> 00:00:22.070
(BELL RINGING)

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.988
GIRL 1: Even the name Lestrange
<i>makes me feel sick.</i>

00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:25.824
You know she stays here every vacation.

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:27.742
Her family don't actually want her home.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:29.285
GIRL 1: I don't blame them.
She's so annoying.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:30.537
Did you see her last week?

00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:31.788
<i>Oscausi!</i>

00:00:36.961 --> 00:00:38.419
GIRL 2: Professor McGonagall!

00:00:38.587 --> 00:00:39.712
Lestrange has done it again!

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:41.965
McGONAGALL: Lestrange, stop running!

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:44.968
- Lestrange! Disobedient children.
- GIRL 3: Leta, come back!

00:00:45.136 --> 00:00:47.303
Stop! Shame on the House of Slytherin.

00:00:47.388 --> 00:00:49.722
A hundred points! Two hundred!

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.558
Get back here, right now!

00:00:53.102 --> 00:00:56.396
Children, stop it! You, stop! Come back!

00:00:56.564 --> 00:00:58.731
BOY 1: Out of my way!
BOY 2: Where has she gone?

00:00:58.899 --> 00:01:00.692
BOY 3: I think she went that way!

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:06.030
Miss, it was Lestrange. She's horrible.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.709
YOUNG LETA: Scamander,
why aren't you packing?

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.502
I'm not going home.

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:21.504
Why not?

00:01:22.298 --> 00:01:24.132
- He needs me.
- (BABY BIRD CHIRPING)

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.306
He was hurt.

00:01:38.355 --> 00:01:39.689
What is that?

00:01:40.357 --> 00:01:41.733
A raven chick.

00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:45.820
Isn't the raven your family emblem?

00:01:45.988 --> 00:01:48.489
- YOUNG LETA: Yes, it is.
- (CHIRPING CONTINUES)

00:02:00.211 --> 00:02:01.419
DUMBLEDORE: All right, Newt.

00:02:02.004 --> 00:02:03.379
<i>Be brave.</i>

00:02:07.843 --> 00:02:09.344
That's an unusual one.

00:02:09.637 --> 00:02:13.890
So Mr. Scamander fears what
more than anything else in the world?

00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:16.643
Having to work in an office, sir.

00:02:16.727 --> 00:02:19.270
- (STUDENTS LAUGHING)
- Go ahead, Newt.

00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:23.566
<i>Riddikulus.</i>

00:02:24.193 --> 00:02:25.193
DUMBLEDORE: Well done.

00:02:25.569 --> 00:02:27.654
- (STUDENTS APPLAUDING)
- Good job. Leta.

00:02:30.574 --> 00:02:31.824
It's only a Boggart.

00:02:31.992 --> 00:02:33.952
It can't hurt you.

00:02:35.996 --> 00:02:38.414
Everyone is scared of something.

00:02:40.125 --> 00:02:41.793
I've been looking forward to this.

00:03:14.702 --> 00:03:15.785
(GASPS)

00:03:26.463 --> 00:03:28.464
I don't want to talk about it.

00:03:44.106 --> 00:03:45.440
YOUNG NEWT: They know me,

00:03:46.734 --> 00:03:48.901
- or they'd hide.
- (SQUEAKING)

00:03:51.113 --> 00:03:53.614
They only nest in trees
with wand-quality wood.

00:03:55.492 --> 00:03:57.160
Did you know that?

00:03:58.954 --> 00:04:01.456
And they have very complex social lives.

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:06.127
If you watch them for long enough,
you realize...

00:04:24.063 --> 00:04:26.981
Hello, Leta. This is a surprise.

00:04:30.569 --> 00:04:33.196
- Finding me in a classroom?
- (CHUCKLES)

00:04:34.365 --> 00:04:35.823
Was I such a bad student?

00:04:35.991 --> 00:04:37.575
On the contrary,
you were one of my cleverest.

00:04:37.659 --> 00:04:39.577
I said "bad," not "stupid."

00:04:45.292 --> 00:04:46.793
Don't bother answering.

00:04:48.462 --> 00:04:49.462
I know you never liked me.

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.963
You're wrong.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.882
I never thought you bad.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.510
You were alone, then.
Everybody else did.

00:04:56.303 --> 00:04:57.720
And they were right.

00:04:59.014 --> 00:05:00.431
I was wicked.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.059
Leta, I know how painful

00:05:03.143 --> 00:05:05.520
the rumors about your brother Corvus
must be for you.

00:05:05.604 --> 00:05:06.771
No, you don't.

00:05:08.482 --> 00:05:10.942
Not unless
you had a brother who died, too.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.194
In my case, it was my sister.

00:05:16.156 --> 00:05:17.782
Did you love her?

00:05:22.496 --> 00:05:24.122
(SIGHS DEEPLY)

00:05:26.417 --> 00:05:28.167
Not as well as I should have done.

00:05:32.089 --> 00:05:33.923
Never too late to free yourself.

00:05:36.301 --> 00:05:40.805
Confession is a relief, I'm told.
A great weight lifted.

00:05:44.893 --> 00:05:46.894
Regret is my constant companion.

00:05:47.938 --> 00:05:50.106
Do not let it become yours.

00:06:00.451 --> 00:06:02.535
Oh! No, thank you.

00:06:02.828 --> 00:06:04.162
Well...

00:06:04.246 --> 00:06:06.080
You've been really kind,

00:06:06.248 --> 00:06:10.418
but my sister Tina's probably
worried sick about me.

00:06:10.586 --> 00:06:13.588
You know,
banging on all the doors and things,

00:06:15.132 --> 00:06:16.382
so I think I'd better be going.

00:06:16.467 --> 00:06:18.551
But you haven't met your host.

00:06:19.261 --> 00:06:20.470
Oh, are you married?

00:06:21.513 --> 00:06:22.805
Let's say,

00:06:24.016 --> 00:06:25.975
deeply committed.

00:06:28.395 --> 00:06:31.230
You see, I can't tell if you're
making a joke or if you're just...

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:34.192
(SIGHS) French.

00:06:34.693 --> 00:06:35.693
(CHUCKLES)

00:06:40.073 --> 00:06:41.073
Oh.

00:06:44.161 --> 00:06:46.704
Hey, knock it off.

00:06:53.921 --> 00:06:55.421
You stay right there.

00:06:56.006 --> 00:06:57.590
I know what you are.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:06:59.675
Queenie.

00:07:01.512 --> 00:07:02.970
We are not here to hurt you.

00:07:04.056 --> 00:07:05.473
We only want to help you.

00:07:07.309 --> 00:07:10.144
You're so very, very far away from home.

00:07:10.771 --> 00:07:14.732
Far away from everything you love,
everything that is comfortable.

00:07:17.277 --> 00:07:19.695
I would never see you harmed.

00:07:20.531 --> 00:07:21.697
Ever.

00:07:23.408 --> 00:07:27.245
It is not your fault
that your sister is an Auror.

00:07:29.289 --> 00:07:31.374
I wish you were working with me now

00:07:32.334 --> 00:07:36.671
towards a world where
we wizards were free to live openly.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.466
To love freely.

00:07:52.604 --> 00:07:54.438
You are an innocent.

00:07:56.817 --> 00:07:58.150
So go now.

00:08:00.112 --> 00:08:01.654
Leave this place.

00:08:15.168 --> 00:08:16.377
(SIGHS)

00:08:22.884 --> 00:08:24.093
(CHUCKLES)

